                <l xml:id="m-23f900b9-87c8-4dde-a395-7d0af8c2575c" facs="#m-48a625c9-0f50-4f07-9db6-4e81516ca0bb" label="ambiguous">1045</l><l xml:id="m-a52da61c-2196-4eb1-9d69-5b55273764b7" facs="#m-564a9ade-0c5a-4d7a-bf95-75ef63a91bdc" label="text-like">16th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-ff7a130c-e28a-449e-b33b-55762aa06846" facs="#m-49dd8a22-c877-469f-9d79-b03521e65e17" label="lyrics-like">quó-ni-am ínops et páu-per sum égo. Gló-ri- a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-9fa62ddd-aa77-45de-b659-cbdeef7846bf" facs="#m-f533760a-9822-457c-a334-0a9ce54d6963" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-dae723d4-5fcb-465c-8a56-91db48078cf5" facs="#m-bb515fb0-2b28-497d-bec9-d35a6ff9a9b7" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c106b1cd-aeb9-4dbc-9dad-33ab2017b229" facs="#m-f0c2a957-98c7-4613-8e76-81f8100de48f" label="lyrics-like">HUA nos, quaésumus, Dómine, sequátur:* ac bonis opéribus júgiter</l><l xml:id="m-dea18db3-8a5b-45c1-ac92-f8b5bfdd692a" facs="#m-ef0b0288-e972-421c-83e3-9a1f4b852575" label="lyrics-like">grátia semper et praevéniat etl praestet esse inténtos. Per Dñum.</l><l xml:id="m-c2c102eb-04f5-46d0-a844-9a13e4849504" facs="#m-0de95da3-01b9-49ba-9002-4a74dfcf852d" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-05dd84ef-533b-4962-8a12-cb303facd463" facs="#m-fa902441-5bc6-406c-ac75-6b8fd1b3cdbc" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Ephesios. Ephes. J. c.</l><l xml:id="m-4bb4d429-a57b-4e45-b5b5-7be95a2a89e5" facs="#m-c3ce983d-ed97-4870-8fbc-daaa2298a05e" label="lyrics-like">NRatres: Obsecro vos, ne defi¬omnibus sanctis, quae sit latitúdo,</l><l xml:id="m-7333ab2e-79a2-41c0-9ddb-60c927deffaa" facs="#m-ba8acfbe-26df-49af-9de4-6b65571bb202" label="lyrics-like">ciátis in tribulatiónibus meis</l><l xml:id="m-10c2707f-c0d5-433c-8d1e-6e1a432ac969" facs="#m-90d0043f-e7b1-4dfa-9fc6-904c960e91c2" label="lyrics-like">et longitúdo, et sublímitas, et pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-28ca54b5-2f41-4de6-ab34-4f6bd2b2eed4" facs="#m-daa2e54e-ae34-4cd8-9374-74fe3450d366" label="lyrics-like">pro vobis: quae est glória vestra.</l><l xml:id="m-c4c53f88-56d3-4504-bd1e-1404b1885f99" facs="#m-984db650-5ecc-419a-b930-091cb198f0c3" label="lyrics-like">fúndum: scire étiam supereminén¬</l><l xml:id="m-d149b210-2822-4c57-89ab-9c2eacf37fe4" facs="#m-c4822cef-08d9-4cf7-bb2b-d4d3c86afdc1" label="lyrics-like">Hujus rei gratia flectõ génua mea</l><l xml:id="m-258a2a90-643f-4a1f-92d9-7db12b97ece5" facs="#m-630c17c5-a627-4ca2-9c99-80435c81c0f4" label="lyrics-like">tem sciéntiae caritátem Christi, ut</l><l xml:id="m-14edfc9f-9bfe-4e98-9084-c9a5b29bf43b" facs="#m-87dbb8ec-052e-4383-8fc6-b94aa01a7d8e" label="lyrics-like">ad Patrem Dómini nostri Jesu Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-68a749b4-c921-42d1-9a9a-a2172af2809e" facs="#m-c14bd758-488d-4f4d-bbfa-2f4b9a8776d0" label="lyrics-like">impleámini in omnem plenitúdinem</l><l xml:id="m-85f8a379-b48f-46fb-b4f4-305639930dc0" facs="#m-5b37ee7a-e6a4-4db4-909c-596ac00b7963" label="lyrics-like">Dei. Ei autem, qui potens est ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-01d3c93a-947f-4298-b10a-03335608ad5f" facs="#m-9034074c-ab2a-4dbc-9f9b-4e669faf1d50" label="lyrics-like">sti, ex quo omnis patérnitas in cae¬</l><l xml:id="m-aeb8f5c0-b9b5-4868-99d9-aaa769afbc04" facs="#m-df7cd456-8b40-43e9-a3e5-a1be6e54a573" label="lyrics-like">lis et in terra nominátur, ut det vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-12444f20-0936-4735-b237-d12f356f3aaa" facs="#m-8dd339b0-cd98-4ce8-a19d-e823dd61856c" label="lyrics-like">fácere superabundánter quam péti¬</l><l xml:id="m-3339068c-9725-4bbf-a3ce-1633f73ae5a3" facs="#m-3cd1a98d-7d55-4478-9634-c44dcbe5f3e3" label="lyrics-like">bis secúndum divítias glóriae suae,</l><l xml:id="m-66a6c0b3-9ca6-4ba8-874c-1798983ebfca" facs="#m-50db5395-8d0a-4d32-a9a6-6687dfc0369d" label="lyrics-like">mus, aut intellígimus, secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-58cbf67f-3628-41a6-ad45-d366d5967555" facs="#m-5dac6f97-b15a-4ec4-9fb8-0492db353d94" label="lyrics-like">virtúte corroborári per Spiritum</l><l xml:id="m-a7cd9fe8-ba98-4afb-9aa1-db7c1eaebd9f" facs="#m-14220bd2-3b41-440c-9ef8-04083f5f32e1" label="lyrics-like">virtútem, quae operátur in nobis:</l><l xml:id="m-39d3ce95-7ff5-49cb-8f96-371c09deea33" facs="#m-dd6d2ad7-9244-47de-9374-7b001fe30ad0" label="lyrics-like">ejus in interiórem bóminem. Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-b089fb96-836c-4710-8aca-27e91f4a1082" facs="#m-1d630574-5f3b-4230-aa6c-f9862890f44a" label="lyrics-like">ipsi glória in Ecclésia, et in Christo</l><l xml:id="m-babd634a-8718-44d9-bb68-c0c051832526" facs="#m-0e44b92f-481d-4928-9dde-1c9e534b2ad0" label="lyrics-like">stum habitáre per fidem in córdibus</l><l xml:id="m-cbc0e41c-70bf-44f0-b18f-0e83198b744c" facs="#m-b0b425bd-a981-4d33-8161-5ccb769b9f73" label="lyrics-like">Jesu, in omnes generatiónes saéculi</l><l xml:id="m-18a985a9-e2b4-481c-b885-eb3b7e74800d" facs="#m-433eff5d-f024-4155-bdf8-0dfdcb452bed" label="lyrics-like">vestris: in caritáte radicáti, et fun¬</l><l xml:id="m-84ddf502-e814-4990-9475-aefdc1888552" facs="#m-83492869-7d43-4eeb-898e-de06dd8e6262" label="lyrics-like">saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-a44fa95f-e4f1-48a1-be72-0bed88a229e0" facs="#m-1fef199d-249d-4be4-99ff-981e74729597" label="lyrics-like">dáti, ut possítis comprehéndere cum</l><l xml:id="m-dbee196e-f149-4b4a-954a-fef099a602cc" facs="#m-b00122b1-c13c-43e6-9fdb-2430e1df0287" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Timébunt géntes. p. 489.</l><l xml:id="m-e8f85cdc-7e5d-4b1e-a66e-c55a14b84fee" facs="#m-dacf6ac0-a94b-4ee3-a696-a41c191bc36d" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-b7c009ed-dcbd-44a7-8f55-be49058c08c1" facs="#m-7c56cab1-7fd8-4485-9e82-aadfa8dc323c" label="lyrics-like">Le-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-44962f45-b36a-442e-b6fc-1b3c963800f3" facs="#m-ba5135c3-a374-4e4c-90a8-fc31d95b4046" label="ambiguous">v. Can¬</l><l xml:id="m-ebe063e0-d6ae-44a2-b94f-76eed511463b" facs="#m-f3fe7e18-2a96-4c10-aee6-b780af0cda36" label="ambiguous">j</l><l xml:id="m-bd3b524c-a011-4a4e-9815-6a38f23f0199" facs="#m-34f68042-4154-4613-b833-f900c961d87b" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-44cd4adb-ef32-4923-a037-5540ee1e62af" facs="#m-0488428b-7e08-46f5-909c-5da18f85f174" label="lyrics-like">te Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-11ff1702-a6ba-4072-ad0c-a93793b100d5" facs="#m-39cee47e-9d0b-49cd-8c04-102020e57feb" label="ambiguous">mi-no</l><l xml:id="m-e6db0924-cd25-4eae-bbac-b3d6a58046ae" facs="#m-da6c2f55-9231-47d7-b8fa-82e99cb7f435" label="lyrics-like">tá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4dfa7678-b057-4ada-9eea-0928dd0206b8" facs="#m-8723c352-2166-48c1-a0b4-8d3b80cd75c9" label="lyrics-like">cum nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-149cee26-1498-4be7-82af-a3937de3be99" facs="#m-82df4d78-170c-4186-a2d5-1997f5fb91be" label="ambiguous">vum: qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-606d2d74-ed9b-4278-884c-2604946917b0" facs="#m-8019dfa2-1ad7-437a-aa5e-039f0a0b15be" label="ambiguous">a mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-40b62f75-0766-4947-aee3-d51efdd4b3dc" facs="#m-1e6dc654-fa9e-4d66-acd7-e14e003f923c" label="lyrics-like">cán¬ ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3843a01-eeb0-49f1-ba13-2b682de0164b" facs="#m-a33368eb-38b0-4e8c-bcf4-c9edd970884c" label="lyrics-like">li- a fé-cit “ Dómi¬ nus.</l><l xml:id="m-c2a869f3-a8d1-45c4-9327-9080914c550b" facs="#m-fcb2fa07-9815-4069-95bb-b454d60fb547" label="lyrics-like">ra-bí¬</l></lg>
